  "details": "Not sure when or why this change came through, but it is causing major behavioral issues when testing my assets in local build & test mode. [see second image] It should (and historically has never) been TRUE in a local test instance. Confirmed via creator docs https://creators.vrchat.com/worlds/udon/networking/network-components#networking-properties [see first image]\n\nI double checked public server instances and those operated as expected, so it's only affecting local testing.\n\nAdditionally, I made other clients also join the local instance and every single one of them also exhibited the same TRUE value for VRCPlayerAPI.isInstanceOwner. Feels like the default value of the property got inverted somehow.\n\nExpectation: Local Test is considered a Public Instance (it even says so in the notifications upon joining the instance), and as such should have NO instance owner.",
